                <mxCell id="journey_j12" value="⑩ 심화 문제(qlevel=02) — 합격선 없음&#xa;풀면 심화완료(3), 만점이면 심화왕(4)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
